  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Black identity is mapped onto the child",
  "description": "The text 'once you go black' is juxtaposed with the visual of a Black child being held by a white woman. The meme implies that the child's Blackness is the defining characteristic that triggers the stereotype of being raised by a single mother, mapping the child's racial identity onto the textual claim about Blackness and single motherhood. This is a harmful analogical mapping that equates Blackness with single motherhood.",
